///
/// @brief Load a shape from a file of supported format, where the file has already been loaded into memory, and baking in some scale, rotation, and translation.
///
/// @details Supported formats: JSON (.mochi.json) and HDF5 (.mochi.h5), auto-detected from header bytes. To load a surface mesh format (OBJ, PLY, OFF, STL) from memory, use the overload that takes an explicit @ref mochi::MeshFileType "MeshFileType".
