///
/// @brief Get the actor handles for the nested rigid link actors.
///
/// @param[in,out] error Error status. Check @ref mochi::Error::IsOK "Error::IsOK" for success.
/// @return Span of actor handles for the nested rigid link actors.
///
/// @note Only applicable to articulated actors.
///
/// @see @ref mochi::Actor::GetNestedSoftActors "GetNestedSoftActors", @ref mochi::Actor::IsNestedLinkActor "IsNestedLinkActor", @ref mochi::Actor::GetArticulatedActor "GetArticulatedActor"
///

